# VIP Reservations translation — INCOMPLETE (open work)

Resume: `@vip-i18n$` / `$vip-translate$`. Design: `.cursor/rules/design-notes-vip-reservations.mdc`, proposal `reports/vip-reservations-proposal.md` §16.

## State (Oct 15 2026)

| Piece | State |
|---|---|
| Feature | PROPOSAL — not built. When built, it ships as a **beta** (`vipReservations`, `IsTestFeature=1`) in **English only** |
| Chrome keys | Must be created as `vip.*` / `legalDocs.*` keys from the first build (no hardcoded strings), English values only |
| Help | English only until this rule is closed |
| Legal Terms text | English only; other languages need counsel-approved versions |

## Why it is INCOMPLETE (owner principle 19: translation is LAST)

1. **Beta copy is still changing** — translating it now means translating it twice.
2. **Legal Terms / refund / no-show text must be lawyer-approved per language** — machine translation is not acceptable for patron-facing legal terms; each language is its own `legalDocuments` version approved by counsel.
3. **Brand protections** — ShoutOut, FloqR, FloqAi, FloqMedia, BartR, Mingl, RydR, supRstar, SupRstR, DonPapi, Stripe, Google, Microsoft, Facebook, WhatsApp, SMS, OTP stay untranslated; the feature's final brand name (owner open question) joins this list.
4. **11 languages required** by `floqr-translation.mdc`: `en`, `de`, `fr`, `es`, `it`, `pt`, `ru`, `el`, `pl`, `nl`, `ar` (Arabic needs RTL checks on the floor map, list view and door screen).

Until this rule is closed, `vipReservations` must **not** go Live (`IsTestFeature` stays 1). This is the only exception to the "no English-only help" rule, and it applies only while the feature is a beta behind the flag.

## Follow-up prompt (run after the beta is stable and the owner says translate)

```
Translate VIP / Table Reservations in two tiers, per floqr-translation.mdc.
Tier A — patrons: Search VIP tile + Beta pill, vip.html (venue picker, nights, floor map + list view, section sheet, party size, hold countdown, consent checkboxes chrome, checkout hand-off, confirmation), My Profile Reservations tab, Inbox/email/SMS confirmation + reminder templates, QR pass page, patron help (help-vip-book-table, help-vip-floor-map, help-vip-terms-consent, help-vip-cancel-refund, help-vip-door-pass) + FloqAi intents.
Tier B — club admins, venue/event admins, promoters, VIP Managers, counsel: Club Admin VIP Reservations tab (Subscription, Floor plans, Nights & pricing, Terms & policies, Team, Promoters, Reservations, Website & API, Activity), vip-door.html, promoter-admin VIP tab, legal-docs.html, their help ids.
Rules: every new English key filled in all 11 packs (CHROME key counts equal), every patron / venueAdmin / serviceMember help id in floqr-i18n-help.js for de fr es it pt ru el pl nl ar, brands untranslated, cache-bust floqr-i18n.js + floqr-i18n-help.js, node scripts/i18n-coverage-report.js exits 0, functions/i18n-coverage.test.js green. Do NOT machine-translate venue Terms / refund / no-show policies — show the counsel-approved language version, or the English version with a "Terms available in English only" notice until counsel approves one. Check RTL (ar) on the floor map, list view and door screen. Then update this rule to Done (or delete it) and record it in design-notes-vip-reservations.mdc.
```

